        "content": "## 🎯 WORKFLOW TRIGGER & TOPIC INIT\nStep 1️⃣ EVERY 3 MINUTES └─ Schedule Trigger fires └─ Initialize Sample Topics loads design topic\n\nStep 2️⃣ READY FOR AI └─ Topic passes to Gemini AI └─ Waiting for content generation",
